<title>CHINA: Trading in Ultronics shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Ultronics shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Ultronics International Holdings Ltd was suspended in the afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the medical and scientific equipment distributor gained HK$0.15 or 15.96 percent to HK$1.09 at midday on volume of 12.03 million shares worth HK$13.14 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
